### Staff sign-in
POST {{host}}/api/commands/staff-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@riverbend.example", "password": "…" }

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/queries/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### List processes
GET {{host}}/api/queries/processes
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Create a process
POST {{host}}/api/commands/create-process
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: create-planner-1

{ "title": { "en": "Planner", "fr": "Urbaniste" }, "hiringManager": "<userId>", "hrAdvisor": "<userId>", "location": "Riverbend, AB" }

### Publish with optimistic concurrency
POST {{host}}/api/commands/publish-posting
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: 12

{ "processId": "<processId>", "closeAt": "2027-01-25 23:59" }

### Timeline
GET {{host}}/api/queries/timeline?processId=<processId>&category=screening
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Staffing file export
GET {{host}}/api/queries/staffing-file?processId=<processId>
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
